harpia-generated
================

Python code generated by harpia from this project's ``.harpia`` schema.

How the generated project is laid out and consumed is described in
``USAGE_EXCERPT.md`` at the root of the generated output (sections 5, 7 and
16 of harpia's ``USAGE.md``, the same excerpt the C++ Doxygen mainpage
renders).

